ated businesses. The Logging and Trading of Timber segment engages in extraction and trading of timber. The Trading segment is involved in trading of construction materials business. The Plantation segment engages in cultivation and sale of agricultural products. The Investment Holding segment is involved in group-level corporate services. The Services segment provides transportation and logistics service. The Other segment engages in entertainment event and renewable energy business. It also provides management services, and engages in management of medical operation. FBG Holdings Berhad was formerly known as Fajarbaru Builder Group Bhd. and changed its name to FBG Holdings Berhad in June 2025. FBG Holdings Berhad was founded in 1976 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia."}}